post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
feagle is installed. Recommended next steps (no root needed):

  feagle setup                      # roots, model download, services, first index
  systemctl --user enable --now feagle-queryd feagle-indexerd

Without llama.cpp and a model, feagle still works as a full-text search.
Check everything with:  feagle doctor
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
